# Energy System Profile

ATP-PC

Very High Contribution.

Anaerobic Glycolysis

Very High Contribution.

Oxidative System

High Contribution.

Explosive throws rely primarily on ATP-PC.

Grip fighting and repeated attacks heavily tax glycolytic metabolism.

The oxidative system supports recovery between exchanges and during Golden Score.

